    <sl-alert variant="neutral" open size="small" style="margin-bottom:16px;max-width:640px;">
        <sl-icon slot="icon" name="shield-exclamation"></sl-icon>
        Keys are encrypted at rest under the master DEK and only usable while the vault is unlocked.
        The full key is shown <strong>once</strong> at creation; afterwards only a short prefix.
        Everything the AI reads is sent to your configured OpenRouter model/provider.
